mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">EAP</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>

<div><a name="_aa920378-0fb8-f873-7906-09e8ccb2e361" id="_aa920378-0fb8-f873-7906-09e8ccb2e361"></a><h3>9.9.31.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Authentication Type</h3>

