<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4ffecb2c-50a2-b0bf-138e-eb3676bcda98" id="_4ffecb2c-50a2-b0bf-138e-eb3676bcda98"></a>This object provides details such as authorization outcome, associated policies related to activity/event.</p>
</div>

<div><a name="_4ac29584-b016-f4b0-4fb9-615768493996" id="_4ac29584-b016-f4b0-4fb9-615768493996"></a><h3>9.9.34.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Autoscale UID</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a27bcd65-5c5b-1719-71cb-d875182d04fc" id="_a27bcd65-5c5b-1719-71cb-d875182d04fc"></a>The unique identifier of the cloud autoscale configuration.</p>
</div>

<div><a name="_60ac6527-4f8d-5d00-ae26-74f8832811f7" id="_60ac6527-4f8d-5d00-ae26-74f8832811f7"></a><h3>9.9.35.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Base Address</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_af613e22-fba7-3c6c-701c-a51ffe79ef50" id="_af613e22-fba7-3c6c-701c-a51ffe79ef50"></a>The memory address where the module was loaded.</p>
</div>

