</div>

<div><a name="_eae3ec8c-27d8-24be-da45-7f939c63958f" id="_eae3ec8c-27d8-24be-da45-7f939c63958f"></a><h3>9.9.130.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Detection UID</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f0a1b085-7791-faa2-2763-41b9099523b1" id="_f0a1b085-7791-faa2-2763-41b9099523b1"></a>The associated unique detection event identifier. For example: detection response events include the Detection ID of the original event.</p>
</div>

<div><a name="_502afa56-1341-2f0e-4119-25648343d032" id="_502afa56-1341-2f0e-4119-25648343d032"></a><h3>9.9.131.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Developer UID</h3>

