</div>

<div><a name="_ab682908-b3e8-543f-b19b-26fb7fc056ee" id="_ab682908-b3e8-543f-b19b-26fb7fc056ee"></a><h3>9.9.135.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Message Digest</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8c2eab8e-1a44-6552-b29d-3a3bedd3f876" id="_8c2eab8e-1a44-6552-b29d-3a3bedd3f876"></a>The message digest attribute contains the fixed length message hash representation and the corresponding hashing algorithm information.</p>
</div>

<div><a name="_75f9a94e-c464-c6fa-21ed-6231781c88ec" id="_75f9a94e-c464-c6fa-21ed-6231781c88ec"></a><h3>9.9.136.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Direction</h3>

